      },
      "text": "## Layer 3 — Counting Surjections"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md#018",
      "path": [
        "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion, git-history:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion]",
        "canonical_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion, derangements, surjections, sieve, bonferroni]",
        "current_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "id": "maxim:combinatorics:inclusion-exclusion",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "combinatorics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion]",
        "section": "combinatorics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Inclusion-Exclusion and the Sieve",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "How many functions `f: [k] → [n]` are **onto** (hit every one of the n\ncodomain elements)?"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md#019",
      "path": [
        "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion, git-history:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion]",
        "canonical_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion, derangements, surjections, sieve, bonferroni]",
        "current_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "id": "maxim:combinatorics:inclusion-exclusion",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "combinatorics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion]",
        "section": "combinatorics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Inclusion-Exclusion and the Sieve",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   Universe U = all n^k functions.\n   Bad property i = \"element i of codomain is MISSED\".\n   A_S = functions avoiding all i in S = (n - |S|)^k."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md#020",
      "path": [
        "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion, git-history:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion]",
        "canonical_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion, derangements, surjections, sieve, bonferroni]",
        "current_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "id": "maxim:combinatorics:inclusion-exclusion",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "combinatorics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion]",
        "section": "combinatorics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Inclusion-Exclusion and the Sieve",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Surj(k,n) = SUM_{j=0}^{n} (-1)^j C(n,j) (n-j)^k."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md#021",
      "path": [
        "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion, git-history:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion]",
        "canonical_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion, derangements, surjections, sieve, bonferroni]",
        "current_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "id": "maxim:combinatorics:inclusion-exclusion",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "combinatorics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion]",
        "section": "combinatorics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Inclusion-Exclusion and the Sieve",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "This equals  n! * S(k,n)   (Stirling 2nd kind) -- cross-check with\n   the twelvefold way (file 01) and special numbers (file 07).\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md#022",
      "path": [
        "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion, git-history:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion]",
        "canonical_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion, derangements, surjections, sieve, bonferroni]",
        "current_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "id": "maxim:combinatorics:inclusion-exclusion",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "combinatorics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion]",
        "section": "combinatorics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Inclusion-Exclusion and the Sieve",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Worked count.** Surjections `[4] → [2]`: `Σ_j (-1)^j C(2,j)(2-j)^4 =\n2^4 - 2·1^4 + 0 = 16 - 2 = 14`. Matches `2!·S(4,2) = 2·7 = 14` from `01`.\nTwo independent methods, same answer — that is how you trust the count."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md#023",
      "path": [
        "04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion, git-history:combinatorics:04-inclusion-exclusion]",
        "canonical_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion, derangements, surjections, sieve, bonferroni]",
        "current_path": "combinatorics/04-INCLUSION-EXCLUSION.md",
        "id": "maxim:combinatorics:inclusion-exclusion",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "combinatorics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[inclusion-exclusion]",
        "section": "combinatorics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Inclusion-Exclusion and the Sieve",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The same I-E template counts: number of ways to **n-color** so that all n colors\nare used; number of **size-n sequences over an n-alphabet using every symbol**;\nthe **Stirling number** `S(k,n) = (1/n!) Σ_j (-1)^j C(n,j)(n-j)^k`."
    },
